WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.980
Who bought the book? Listen to where the focus falls.

2
00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:07.870
Anna kupiła książkę.

3
00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:11.860
Neutral order: who, then what.

4
00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:14.350
Książkę kupiła Anna.

5
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:19.620
The same words. Now the new information comes last.

6
00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:23.190
To Anna kupiła tę książkę, nie Piotr.

7
00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:28.060
Ten film bardzo mi się podoba.

8
00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:34.060
Endings show who does what, so word order is free.

9
00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:40.610
New information goes last, and short pronouns never start a sentence.

10
00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:45.890
Answer the question: who bought the book?

11
00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:50.230
Książkę kupiła Anna.

12
00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:54.790
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

13
00:00:56.590 --> 00:00:58.430
Książkę kupiła Anna.

14
00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:05.670
Him I did not see, but her I did. Say it as a woman.

15
00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:10.530
Jego nie widziałam, ale ją tak.

16
00:01:11.330 --> 00:01:15.090
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

17
00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:19.250
Jego nie widziałam, ale ją tak.

18
00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:24.890
Now practise with the exercises below the video.
